{"type":"message","id":"07de49ea","parentId":"7a755d7f","timestamp":"2026-06-03T13:39:49.819Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec_ts_ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Usage: gog <command> [flags]\nBuild: v0.13.0 (5cd913e)\n\nGoogle CLI for\nGmail/Calendar/Chat/Classroom/Drive/Contacts/Tasks/Sheets/Docs/Slides/People/Forms/App\nScript/Ads/Groups/Admin/Keep\n\nConfig:\n\n    file: /home/bhard/.config/gogcli/config.json\n    keyring backend: auto (source: default)\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help                   Show context-sensitive help.\n      --color=\"auto\"           Color output: auto|always|never\n  -a, --account=STRING         Account email for API commands\n                               (gmail/calendar/chat/classroom/drive/docs/slides/contacts/tasks/people/sheets/forms/appscript/ads)\n      --client=\"\"              OAuth client name (selects stored credentials +\n                               token bucket)\n      --access-token=STRING    Use provided access token directly (bypasses\n                               stored refresh tokens; token expires in ~1h)\n                               ($GOG_ACCESS_TOKEN)\n      --enable-commands=\"\"     Comma-separated list of enabled commands;\n                               dot paths allowed (restricts CLI)\n      --disable-commands=\"\"    Comma-separated list of disabled commands;\n                               dot paths allowed\n      --gmail-no-send          Block Gmail send operations (agent safety)\n  -j, --json                   Output JSON to stdout (best for scripting)\n  -p, --plain                  Output stable, parseable text to stdout (TSV;\n                               no colors)\n      --results-only           In JSON mode, emit only the primary result (drops\n                               envelope fields like nextPageToken)\n      --select=STRING          In JSON mode, select comma-separated fields\n                               (best-effort; supports dot paths). Desire path:\n                               use --fields for most commands.\n  -n, --dry-run                Do not make changes; print intended actions and\n                               exit successfully\n  -y, --force                  Skip confirmations for destructive commands\n      --no-input               Never prompt; fail instead (useful for CI)\n  -v, --verbose                Enable verbose logging\n      --version                Print version and exit\n\nCommands:\n  send [flags]\n    Send an email (alias for 'gmail send')\n\n  ls (list) [flags]\n    List Drive files (alias for 'drive ls')\n\n  search (find) <query> ... [flags]\n    Search Drive files (alias for 'drive search')\n\n  open (browse) <target> [flags]\n    Print a best-effort web URL for a Google URL/ID (offline)\n\n  download (dl) <fileId> [flags]\n    Download a Drive file (alias for 'drive download')\n\n  upload (up,put) <localPath> [flags]\n    Upload a file to Drive (alias for 'drive upload')\n\n  login <email> [flags]\n    Authorize and store a refresh token (alias for 'auth add')\n\n  logout <email> [flags]\n    Remove a stored refresh token (alias for 'auth remove')\n\n  status (st) [flags]\n    Show auth/config status (alias for 'auth status')\n\n  me [flags]\n    Show your profile (alias for 'people me')\n\n  whoami (who-am-i) [flags]\n    Show your profile (alias for 'people me')\n\n  auth <command> [flags]\n    Auth and credentials\n\n  groups (group) <command> [flags]\n    Google Groups\n\n  admin <command> [flags]\n    Google Workspace Admin (Directory API) - requires domain-wide delegation\n\n  drive (drv) <command> [flags]\n    Google Drive\n\n  docs (doc) <command> [flags]\n    Google Docs (export via Drive)\n\n  slides (slide) <command> [flags]\n    Google Slides\n\n  calendar (cal) <command> [flags]\n    Google Calendar\n\n  classroom (class) <command> [flags]\n    Google Classroom\n\n  time <command> [flags]\n    Local time ut